1
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,590
I always knew you'd make something of yourself,

2
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:54,150
but I never imagined you'd be so brave.

3
00:01:55,480 --> 00:01:56,280
This time,

4
00:01:57,430 --> 00:02:00,230
to save me, Xiang Bei,

5
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:04,640
and a train car full of people... you sacrificed yourself.

6
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:14,310
Now everyone thinks you're a hero,

7
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:18,910
but I'd rather you weren't a hero,

8
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:21,710
and just came back to be

9
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,430
my mischievous son.

10
00:02:39,710 --> 00:02:40,520
Son,

11
00:02:42,430 --> 00:02:43,430
all Dad can do now

12
00:02:45,710 --> 00:02:47,520
is be proud of you.

13
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,190
Xiang Pingsheng.

14
00:04:02,750 --> 00:04:05,190
I heard about what happened to your son.

15
00:04:05,590 --> 00:04:07,750
I originally wanted to humiliate Wei Tian,

16
00:04:08,430 --> 00:04:10,750
but since Zhong An loves meddling so much,

17
00:04:11,150 --> 00:04:12,520
then go right ahead and meddle.

18
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,590
I knew it was you.

19
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,750
What else do you want?

20
00:04:21,750 --> 00:04:25,160
When you were at the International Security Conference,

21
00:04:25,270 --> 00:04:26,630
spouting all that nonsense,

22
00:04:27,070 --> 00:04:28,680
did you never stop to think

23
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,720
you were messing with a lot of people's money?

24
00:04:31,190 --> 00:04:31,920
Did you honestly think

25
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,390
I would let you off so easily?

26
00:04:33,390 --> 00:04:34,480
Dream on.

27
00:04:35,310 --> 00:04:37,040
I want everyone to know

28
00:04:37,310 --> 00:04:39,720
that choosing Zhong An comes at a price.

29
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,800
Fine, Hades.

30
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,310
No matter where you hide,

31
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:49,000
neither I nor Zhong An will ever let you off.

32
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,750
Cut the crap.

33
00:04:50,950 --> 00:04:52,070
Listen to me carefully.

34
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,600
The game has officially begun.

35
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:56,750
There is a bus

36
00:04:56,870 --> 00:04:58,950
that is about to cross paths with an oil tanker.

37
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:01,000
Both vehicles are rigged with bombs.

38
00:05:02,190 --> 00:05:04,190
When they are within 100 meters of each other,

39
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:07,190
the timers on the bombs will activate.

40
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,270
If an engine shuts off,

41
00:05:09,750 --> 00:05:11,920
if they get more than 100 meters apart,

42
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:15,360
or if the timer runs out... boom.

43
00:05:17,750 --> 00:05:18,870
What do you think?

44
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,480
Where are the two vehicles right now?

45
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,160
You think I'd just tell you?

46
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:26,160
If the bombs just went off immediately,

47
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,190
wouldn't that spoil all the fun?

48
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:31,920
Now, there are two rules to the game

49
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:33,240
that you must follow.

50
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:37,040
No passenger or driver may leave the vehicles.

51
00:05:37,390 --> 00:05:39,310
Only one person may board each vehicle.

52
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:42,430
Both bombs must be defused at the exact same time.

53
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,680
Otherwise,

54
00:05:43,950 --> 00:05:45,560
I'll treat you to a free show—

55
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:47,720
a gorgeous fireworks display on the highway.

56
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:50,390
Sounds good? Best of luck.

57
00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:55,070
Mr. Xiang.

58
00:05:55,510 --> 00:05:57,480
The Shida Communications bus bound for Sovnik

59
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,750
lost contact before entering the West Intercity Highway.

60
00:06:00,190 --> 00:06:01,600
There are two company employees on board,

61
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,070
plus four family members.

62
00:06:04,510 --> 00:06:05,720
Call the bomb squad.

63
00:06:06,270 --> 00:06:08,920
Have Xiang Bei head to the West Intercity Highway.

64
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:09,310
Yes, sir.

65
00:06:17,950 --> 00:06:20,000
Rossi, dinner is ready.

66
00:06:20,270 --> 00:06:21,120
Still not back?

67
00:06:21,270 --> 00:06:22,390
We're right at the base gate.

68
00:06:22,390 --> 00:06:24,160
Wei Tian, Zhong An is in trouble.

69
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,510
Coming!

70
00:06:31,270 --> 00:06:32,070
Where are you going?

71
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,430
What's going on?

72
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:34,750
I'll call you!

73
00:06:36,070 --> 00:06:36,560
Wait...

74
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,560
Come on, let's eat.

75
00:06:42,390 --> 00:06:43,270
So many dishes!

76
00:06:43,870 --> 00:06:44,480
Let's dig in.

77
00:06:44,630 --> 00:06:45,040
All right.

78
00:07:02,750 --> 00:07:03,560
What did you find?

79
00:07:05,070 --> 00:07:07,270
Found it. It's a 30-ton fuel tanker.

80
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,800
Let's hope Wei Tian can

81
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,560
stop that bus for us.

82
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:31,240
Target spotted. Prepare to intercept.

83
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,600
Wei Tian, is that you?

84
00:07:33,630 --> 00:07:34,430
Xiang Bei.

85
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,430
Hello. Go ahead.

86
00:07:36,870 --> 00:07:38,190
This is an attack by the international terrorist

87
00:07:38,190 --> 00:07:40,390
Hades, targeting Zhong An.

88
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:42,270
His condition is that

89
00:07:42,270 --> 00:07:43,680
only one person is allowed per vehicle,

90
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,830
or he'll detonate the bombs.

91
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,720
Whether he's telling the truth or not,

92
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:47,680
we must be careful.

93
00:07:47,830 --> 00:07:48,630
Copy that.

94
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,950
I'll chase the tanker ahead. I'll leave this to you.

95
00:07:51,310 --> 00:07:52,120
Rossi.

96
00:07:53,310 --> 00:07:54,160
Let's overtake it.

97
00:08:23,630 --> 00:08:24,430
What's going on?

98
00:08:27,870 --> 00:08:29,720
Uncle Quan, what's happening?

99
00:08:31,310 --> 00:08:32,720
Don't tell me they're robbers.

100
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:33,550
Robbers?

101
00:08:33,550 --> 00:08:34,630
I can't be that unlucky.

102
00:08:34,790 --> 00:08:36,840
It's only my first day in Antilocaris!

103
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,510
Be careful.

104
00:09:06,750 --> 00:09:07,150
Okay.

105
00:09:58,030 --> 00:09:59,670
Are you crazy? Do you have a death wish?

106
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,960
Sir, please calm down.

107
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:03,200
Don't stop. Maintain this speed.

108
00:10:03,510 --> 00:10:05,790
Keep this distance from the tanker ahead.

109
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:07,200
There's a bomb in our car.

110
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,240
Are you serious?

111
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,360
A Zhong An vehicle just passed by.

112
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:15,720
Are you with Zhong An too?

113
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:19,270
Stay calm. Don't move.

114
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,910
We'll carefully find the bomb.

115
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:26,080
Xiang Bei, we only have five kilometers left.

116
00:10:26,270 --> 00:10:27,270
Only three minutes left.

117
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:30,000
Find that bomb as fast as you can, too.

118
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,510
Be careful.

119
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,750
Who are you? What are you doing?

120
00:10:55,910 --> 00:10:57,030
I'm a Zhong An Security Officer.

121
00:10:57,270 --> 00:10:58,630
There's a bomb in your car right now.

122
00:10:59,790 --> 00:11:02,030
Listen to me. Keep a steady speed and don't stop.

123
00:11:02,030 --> 00:11:03,510
Otherwise, the bomb will detonate.

124
00:11:03,510 --> 00:11:04,150
Understand?

125
00:11:04,150 --> 00:11:05,000
Okay, okay, okay.

126
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,150
Keep your speed steady. I'll check in the back.

127
00:11:33,550 --> 00:11:33,870
Okay.

128
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:54,440
Wei Tian! Wei Tian!

129
00:11:55,670 --> 00:11:56,510
I've found the bomb.

130
00:11:56,790 --> 00:11:57,480
That's great!

131
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,200
I need some time.

132
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:01,510
This bomb isn't very powerful,

133
00:12:01,510 --> 00:12:02,600
but the problem is this fuel tank.

134
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:04,790
Listen, Wei Tian.

135
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:07,150
You need to find the bomb on your end fast.

136
00:12:07,510 --> 00:12:08,270
For now, try to find a way

137
00:12:08,270 --> 00:12:09,550
to keep the passengers calm.

138
00:12:09,550 --> 00:12:10,150
Copy that.

139
00:12:13,790 --> 00:12:14,440
Wei Tian?

140
00:12:15,150 --> 00:12:15,960
Wei Tian!

141
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,270
Xiang Bei?

142
00:12:18,790 --> 00:12:19,600
Xiang Bei!

143
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:22,480
Hades...

144
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:24,440
Wei Tian, you can do this.

145
00:12:24,790 --> 00:12:26,840
I bypassed some of Hades' jamming.

146
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,750
I can only connect to one device right now.

147
00:12:32,510 --> 00:12:33,790
Zhong An's rescue vehicles are here!

148
00:12:57,390 --> 00:12:59,150
Wei Tian! Wei Tian!

149
00:12:59,790 --> 00:13:00,600
Wei Tian!

150
00:13:05,750 --> 00:13:06,550
Wei Tian! Wei Tian!

151
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:08,000
Copy that.

152
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,120
Looks like comms are back.

153
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:13,720
I found the bomb.

154
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:15,120
Listen, Wei Tian.

155
00:13:15,510 --> 00:13:17,120
The radar on this bomb measures distance.

156
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:18,080
There's no way to move it.

157
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,870
The vehicle has to keep moving.

158
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:20,910
I know.

159
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:24,030
Be careful!

160
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:26,750
Hades installed surveillance

161
00:13:26,750 --> 00:13:27,630
in both of our vehicles.

162
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:30,270
If we want to evacuate everyone,

163
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,270
we must pull off a deception.

164
00:13:32,270 --> 00:13:33,000
Understood.

165
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:36,240
Shen Yu, we need backup over here!

166
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:38,200
Hurry, send two people to assist us!

167
00:13:38,550 --> 00:13:39,200
All right.

168
00:13:48,030 --> 00:13:49,320
Shalan, you're up.

169
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:51,510
Consider it done.

170
00:13:52,870 --> 00:13:53,910
What he's using...

171
00:13:54,550 --> 00:13:55,630
should be high-frequency.

172
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:56,840
Let me try.

173
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:03,630
No problem.

174
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,200
As long as this three-second clip

175
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:07,550
loops in Hades' system,

176
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:08,910
he won't notice a thing.

177
00:14:10,670 --> 00:14:11,480
Great!

178
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:13,440
That means they can get off now.

179
00:14:18,550 --> 00:14:19,200
Everyone!

180
00:14:20,630 --> 00:14:22,240
Please move to the rescue vehicle!

181
00:14:27,150 --> 00:14:28,910
Found the bomb! It's under the fuel tank.

182
00:14:29,270 --> 00:14:30,480
I'm going to detonate it in a moment,

183
00:14:30,510 --> 00:14:31,480
so you need to get off first!

184
00:14:31,670 --> 00:14:32,480
Okay, okay, got it.

185
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:34,440
Come on, I'll take the wheel.

186
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:35,600
Come on.

187
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:38,960
Give me the gas pedal!

188
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:45,120
Come on, take it easy.

189
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:49,720
Easy.

190
00:14:50,390 --> 00:14:51,440
Come on, good.

191
00:14:52,390 --> 00:14:53,200
Come on.

192
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,030
Here.

193
00:14:55,550 --> 00:14:56,360
Careful!

194
00:14:57,030 --> 00:14:57,630
Get in!

195
00:14:58,550 --> 00:14:58,750
Go!

196
00:14:58,750 --> 00:14:59,630
I'll swap with you.

197
00:14:59,790 --> 00:15:00,790
Okay, okay.

198
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:07,670
Watch out!

199
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:12,870
Come on.

200
00:15:49,390 --> 00:15:50,750
Wei Tian! Wei Tian!

201
00:15:51,870 --> 00:15:52,600
Everyone else

202
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:54,480
has been safely evacuated to the rescue vehicle.

203
00:15:54,750 --> 00:15:55,480
I'm heading out right now

204
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:57,080
to find another vehicle to get you out.

205
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:20,480
It's okay. You're safe now.

206
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:26,550
Watch out!

207
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:28,310
Be careful.

208
00:17:47,030 --> 00:17:48,240
How are you? Are you alright, Wei Tian?

209
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:48,960
I'm fine.

210
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:52,200
Wei Tian.

211
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,550
Are they from Zhong An?

212
00:17:58,640 --> 00:17:59,750
Looks like a Zhong An car.

213
00:17:59,750 --> 00:18:01,000
Could my dad have sent them?

214
00:18:01,270 --> 00:18:03,160
Look, someone's stepping out.

215
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:06,160
Wei Tian! Wei Tian!

216
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:07,640
It's Anda.

217
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:08,270
Anda!

218
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:08,880
Wei Tian!

219
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:10,270
Isn't she supposed to be at the Silent Protectors base?

220
00:18:17,550 --> 00:18:19,640
This won't do. Wei Tian is in grave danger.

221
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:20,790
Shen Yu.

222
00:18:20,790 --> 00:18:22,480
Evacuate the Shida Communications staff.

223
00:18:22,550 --> 00:18:23,640
Okay. What about you?

224
00:18:23,640 --> 00:18:24,550
I'm going to help Wei Tian.

225
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:28,350
Be careful.

226
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:29,160
Will do.

227
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:40,000
Wei Tian!

228
00:18:45,400 --> 00:18:47,400
Wei Tian, save me!

229
00:18:55,240 --> 00:18:56,350
Hello, Wei Tian.

230
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:58,680
You really know me best.

231
00:18:59,160 --> 00:19:00,440
You know that making someone watch their loved one

232
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:01,750
die right in front of them

233
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:03,400
is something only I would do.

234
00:19:04,440 --> 00:19:06,200
I just wanted to kindly remind you,

235
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:08,680
if you can't even protect your own friends,

236
00:19:08,680 --> 00:19:10,440
stop meddling in other people's business.

237
00:19:10,590 --> 00:19:11,400
All right?

238
00:19:11,720 --> 00:19:12,310
By the way,

239
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:13,720
have you taken quite a liking

240
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:15,440
to defusing my bombs lately?

241
00:19:15,830 --> 00:19:17,400
Then I'll just give you another one.

242
00:19:18,590 --> 00:19:20,680
Wei Tian! Wei Tian!

243
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:23,790
Goodbye.

244
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:31,240
Throw it down!

245
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:32,000
Wei Tian!

246
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:50,440
Wei Tian, stay back!

247
00:19:52,070 --> 00:19:52,590
Don't come any closer!

248
00:19:52,590 --> 00:19:53,160
Don't move!

249
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:03,400
Don't move!

250
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:16,790
Shalan,

251
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:19,160
the bomb on Anda

252
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:22,270
has been remotely activated by Hades.

253
00:20:24,400 --> 00:20:25,030
Anda,

254
00:20:26,310 --> 00:20:28,110
don't breathe so fast. Slow down.

255
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:44,920
When did she run off?

256
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:46,160
I really didn't notice.

257
00:20:47,400 --> 00:20:49,110
Just wait till Wei Tian chews you out.

258
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:50,590
Why would Wei Tian lecture me?

259
00:20:50,750 --> 00:20:52,310
I'm not related to her or anything.

260
00:20:52,310 --> 00:20:54,030
Besides, it's not my job to watch Anda.

261
00:20:55,350 --> 00:20:56,160
See?

262
00:20:56,550 --> 00:20:57,750
And you say you're not worried.

263
00:21:16,590 --> 00:21:17,400
Give me your hand.

264
00:21:21,310 --> 00:21:22,440
Shalan, no.

265
00:21:23,510 --> 00:21:25,160
Anda's heart rate is normal,

266
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:28,000
but the bomb's timer is ticking faster and faster.

267
00:21:28,350 --> 00:21:29,680
I believe this bomb

268
00:21:29,790 --> 00:21:31,400
works inversely to her heart rate.

269
00:21:32,440 --> 00:21:33,440
Think of something, fast!

270
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:36,270
Anda and I are going to start running faster.

271
00:21:36,750 --> 00:21:38,200
Don't let her run too far!

272
00:21:38,400 --> 00:21:40,070
We won't be able to analyze the bomb program,

273
00:21:40,070 --> 00:21:41,960
and the comm range is limited too.

274
00:21:45,590 --> 00:21:46,790
Let me connect the laptop first.

275
00:21:56,270 --> 00:21:57,240
Shalan, look!

276
00:22:13,590 --> 00:22:14,110
How's it looking?

277
00:22:15,240 --> 00:22:15,960
What's the status?

278
00:22:18,440 --> 00:22:20,550
What on earth is Hades trying to do?

279
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:23,310
Can you zoom in a bit more here?

280
00:22:23,310 --> 00:22:23,750
Sure.

281
00:22:26,110 --> 00:22:26,750
Like this?

282
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:32,350
It's one of these three wires.

283
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:35,680
But these three are way too close together.

284
00:22:35,920 --> 00:22:37,310
And they're located so close to the bomb.

285
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:39,270
Unless she stays completely still,

286
00:22:39,270 --> 00:22:41,000
it's impossible to defuse it.

287
00:22:42,750 --> 00:22:44,160
How's the heart rate monitoring?

288
00:22:45,750 --> 00:22:46,680
Currently, the heart rate

289
00:22:46,720 --> 00:22:48,640
triggered the alarm at 140.

290
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:50,960
Analyzing the intensity of the recent alarm,

291
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:52,310
120 beats per minute

292
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:53,830
is likely the trigger point.

293
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:57,070
It's hard to maintain that heart rate while staying still.

294
00:22:57,510 --> 00:22:59,400
If we can defuse the bomb in time,

295
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:00,590
it's not completely impossible.

296
00:23:01,680 --> 00:23:03,200
Are you confident you can quickly

297
00:23:03,200 --> 00:23:05,070
hack and override the detonation system?

298
00:23:05,070 --> 00:23:05,830
I'll try.

299
00:23:07,200 --> 00:23:08,030
I'll be as fast as I can.

300
00:23:08,070 --> 00:23:08,830
But I'm not sure

301
00:23:08,830 --> 00:23:10,750
what heart rate actually triggers it.

302
00:23:10,920 --> 00:23:12,110
Besides, the risk is way too high.

303
00:23:24,880 --> 00:23:27,270
Just go. I can't make it. I really can't.

304
00:23:27,550 --> 00:23:28,510
Just leave. Go!

305
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:29,830
Just go.

306
00:23:29,920 --> 00:23:30,720
Shalan.

307
00:23:31,920 --> 00:23:33,030
Do we still have a chance?

308
00:23:34,030 --> 00:23:36,920
Wei Tian, you're on your own now.

309
00:23:40,240 --> 00:23:41,030
Anda.

310
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:42,790
Don't be afraid.

311
00:23:43,590 --> 00:23:44,400
I'll stay with you.

312
00:23:46,640 --> 00:23:48,270
No, don't!

313
00:23:51,030 --> 00:23:53,000
Let's see how lucky we are.

314
00:24:03,920 --> 00:24:04,920
That little friend of yours...

315
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:07,790
looks great in the camo I gave her.

316
00:24:07,790 --> 00:24:08,720
I'm captivated.

317
00:24:09,160 --> 00:24:12,720
Wei Tian, figured out how to defuse my bomb?

318
00:24:13,110 --> 00:24:14,110
Which wire to cut?

319
00:24:14,750 --> 00:24:18,440
Red? Yellow? Blue?

320
00:24:19,270 --> 00:24:20,510
Time's almost up.

321
00:24:20,880 --> 00:24:21,550
Five.

322
00:24:22,270 --> 00:24:23,070
Four.

323
00:24:24,110 --> 00:24:24,790
Three.

324
00:24:25,270 --> 00:24:26,070
Two.

325
00:24:26,400 --> 00:24:27,400
I don't need to choose.

326
00:24:33,750 --> 00:24:35,000
Always so smart.

327
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:36,830
Is this game...

328
00:24:36,830 --> 00:24:38,240
more thrilling than the one...

329
00:24:38,240 --> 00:24:39,680
we played back in the deep sea?

330
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:42,200
Wei Tian, you know...

331
00:24:42,400 --> 00:24:43,920
I can't bear to let you die.

332
00:24:45,030 --> 00:24:47,110
Listen. Torturing you...

333
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:49,200
is my greatest pleasure.

334
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:50,110
Hades.

335
00:24:51,030 --> 00:24:52,680
If you don't blow me up today,

336
00:24:52,830 --> 00:24:54,030
you'll definitely regret it.

337
00:24:54,350 --> 00:24:57,160
I decide when you die.

338
00:25:05,240 --> 00:25:06,240
The bomb is fake.

339
00:25:11,480 --> 00:25:11,960
It's over now.

340
00:25:20,880 --> 00:25:22,070
The soup is ready.

341
00:25:22,110 --> 00:25:23,720
It helps calm the nerves.

342
00:25:24,310 --> 00:25:25,510
Who's taking it?

343
00:25:35,510 --> 00:25:37,240
How about I take it over?

344
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:40,590
Go ahead.

345
00:25:47,880 --> 00:25:48,270
Sit down.

346
00:25:57,590 --> 00:25:58,350
How is she?

347
00:25:58,350 --> 00:25:59,200
Any better?

348
00:26:00,350 --> 00:26:01,350
She woke up earlier,

349
00:26:01,510 --> 00:26:02,960
but she's asleep again.

350
00:26:04,550 --> 00:26:05,400
I have other things to handle.

351
00:26:05,510 --> 00:26:06,720
Take good care of her for me.

352
00:26:21,590 --> 00:26:24,240
Uncle Qu specially made this soup for you.

353
00:26:25,550 --> 00:26:26,400
Thank you.

354
00:26:27,920 --> 00:26:28,720
Don't mention it.

355
00:26:29,400 --> 00:26:30,830
I was just delivering it.

356
00:26:31,030 --> 00:26:32,030
So don't read into it.

357
00:26:36,440 --> 00:26:38,440
Dad, I want to stay here.

358
00:26:40,640 --> 00:26:41,790
Changed your mind?

359
00:26:42,240 --> 00:26:44,000
I know it was Hades who killed my brother.

360
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:46,440
I'm going to catch him here myself.

361
00:26:49,110 --> 00:26:51,440
If we work closely with the Silent Protectors,

362
00:26:53,000 --> 00:26:54,550
we'll stand a much better chance.

363
00:26:57,350 --> 00:26:57,680
Dad...

364
00:26:58,960 --> 00:27:00,310
Completing today's mission

365
00:27:00,550 --> 00:27:02,000
was thanks to Wei Tian keeping his cool.

366
00:27:03,110 --> 00:27:05,270
I really admire him.

367
00:27:05,400 --> 00:27:06,350
That's the spirit.

368
00:27:09,590 --> 00:27:10,550
Looks like

369
00:27:12,160 --> 00:27:14,590
the burden Xiang Lai left behind

370
00:27:16,200 --> 00:27:17,960
falls on you now.

371
00:27:18,920 --> 00:27:21,310
Dad, I really admire you, too.

372
00:27:22,590 --> 00:27:23,720
You really have great judgment.

373
00:27:46,880 --> 00:27:48,070
You're still up this late?

374
00:27:48,310 --> 00:27:49,920
Yeah, you're not asleep either.

375
00:27:51,480 --> 00:27:52,550
I wanted to talk to you.

376
00:27:53,110 --> 00:27:53,920
What is it?

377
00:27:54,960 --> 00:27:55,880
Well...

378
00:27:58,590 --> 00:28:02,070
It's about you saving me.

379
00:28:03,000 --> 00:28:05,030
I think... Actually...

380
00:28:05,110 --> 00:28:06,960
Actually... Actually...

381
00:28:07,830 --> 00:28:08,830
It's pretty late.

382
00:28:09,720 --> 00:28:10,750
Get some rest.

383
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:13,200
Good night.

384
00:29:11,030 --> 00:29:12,350
I heard that around here,

385
00:29:12,350 --> 00:29:16,070
a terrorist attack happened seven years ago,

386
00:29:17,110 --> 00:29:19,000
so it was rebuilt.

387
00:29:19,960 --> 00:29:20,590
Right.

388
00:29:22,070 --> 00:29:25,160
That terrorist attack was deliberate,

389
00:29:25,480 --> 00:29:26,750
and targeted.

390
00:29:28,590 --> 00:29:29,550
It targeted me.

391
00:29:31,550 --> 00:29:32,680
In 2011,

392
00:29:33,790 --> 00:29:35,160
on July 23rd,

393
00:29:35,960 --> 00:29:37,110
at 4:00 p.m.,

394
00:29:39,350 --> 00:29:40,510
a bomb went off here.

395
00:29:42,310 --> 00:29:43,590
33 people were killed,

396
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:45,720
and 59 were injured.

397
00:29:51,160 --> 00:29:54,550
So that's why you remember the news

398
00:29:54,550 --> 00:29:56,400
of that terrorist attack so clearly.

399
00:30:02,310 --> 00:30:03,550
Out of those 59 people,

400
00:30:03,830 --> 00:30:05,440
I was one of the injured.

401
00:30:06,480 --> 00:30:09,880
Xiang Pingsheng pulled me out back then.

402
00:30:11,750 --> 00:30:12,960
He saved my life.

403
00:30:17,920 --> 00:30:18,720
Then...

404
00:30:20,550 --> 00:30:23,070
what about your wife and daughter?

405
00:30:24,030 --> 00:30:25,030
They're gone.

406
00:30:38,920 --> 00:30:39,720
Anda.

407
00:30:41,110 --> 00:30:43,550
I think here in Antilocaris,

408
00:30:44,830 --> 00:30:47,510
some people are meant to stay,

409
00:30:49,200 --> 00:30:50,030
while others...

410
00:30:51,510 --> 00:30:52,510
simply aren't.

411
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:01,590
At ease.

412
00:31:03,480 --> 00:31:03,960
Attention!

413
00:31:05,830 --> 00:31:08,480
Shen Yu, want to try something exciting?

414
00:31:09,350 --> 00:31:09,920
Sure.

415
00:31:10,510 --> 00:31:12,030
Let's have a match, just the two of us.

416
00:31:12,240 --> 00:31:13,550
Winner gets a month's bonus.

417
00:31:13,960 --> 00:31:15,070
Deal.

418
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:57,160
Come on! Come on! Come on!

419
00:32:20,240 --> 00:32:21,200
Another tie.

420
00:32:21,480 --> 00:32:22,000
Again.

421
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:22,750
All right.

422
00:33:03,440 --> 00:33:04,400
Is Xiang Bei okay?

423
00:34:59,960 --> 00:35:01,030
Good job on the mission.

424
00:35:01,030 --> 00:35:02,710
I'll get you the intel on the next target shortly.

425
00:36:06,800 --> 00:36:08,400
Take a look around. See what you like.

426
00:36:16,480 --> 00:36:17,320
Good eye.

427
00:36:18,480 --> 00:36:19,510
How much is this?

428
00:36:20,190 --> 00:36:23,440
This was used by royalty. 800 dollars.

429
00:36:23,510 --> 00:36:24,550
Quite a bargain, isn't it?

430
00:36:28,070 --> 00:36:30,110
The craftsman's name is engraved on the bottom.

431
00:36:30,510 --> 00:36:31,960
A pot used by royalty would never

432
00:36:31,960 --> 00:36:33,710
have the craftsman's name engraved on it.

433
00:36:34,480 --> 00:36:36,960
And they wouldn't use a style like this.

434
00:36:49,400 --> 00:36:50,760
That's way too low.

435
00:36:51,800 --> 00:36:52,590
This price

436
00:36:53,030 --> 00:36:54,960
already exceeds what it's worth.

437
00:36:55,590 --> 00:36:56,510
You know full well

438
00:36:57,030 --> 00:36:58,760
no one else would offer this much.

439
00:37:02,320 --> 00:37:03,630
So, are you selling it or not?

440
00:37:05,400 --> 00:37:07,480
Fine, fine! I'll sell it. You got a deal.

441
00:37:09,230 --> 00:37:10,030
I'll pack it up for you.

442
00:37:47,880 --> 00:37:48,670
Rossi,

443
00:37:49,000 --> 00:37:51,320
with all this equipment and the way you look,

444
00:37:51,550 --> 00:37:52,880
you look just like a witch.

445
00:37:55,000 --> 00:37:55,710
Yeah.

446
00:37:56,360 --> 00:37:57,800
Why did you make today's coffee

447
00:37:58,400 --> 00:38:00,000
with so much ceremony?

448
00:38:00,550 --> 00:38:02,710
Because of the weather, because of the scenery,

449
00:38:03,400 --> 00:38:04,550
and because the air

450
00:38:04,630 --> 00:38:06,230
is filled with a scent I love.

451
00:38:07,150 --> 00:38:08,150
In any case,

452
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:10,760
life always needs a sense of ritual.

453
00:38:46,280 --> 00:38:48,400
This coffee tastes so weird.

454
00:38:48,710 --> 00:38:50,670
There are even grounds in it.

455
00:38:50,670 --> 00:38:51,760
It's so thick,

456
00:38:51,760 --> 00:38:53,190
and it's really bitter.

457
00:38:54,590 --> 00:38:57,760
That's the style of Turkish coffee.

458
00:38:58,360 --> 00:39:00,000
You have to savor it slowly

459
00:39:00,400 --> 00:39:02,190
to taste all the layers.

460
00:39:02,440 --> 00:39:04,320
If every gulp tastes the same,

461
00:39:04,710 --> 00:39:05,760
that's cola.

462
00:39:14,480 --> 00:39:15,840
You think it's bitter too, don't you?

463
00:39:19,840 --> 00:39:22,360
The first sip is bitter like life;

464
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:25,510
the second sip is sweet like love.

465
00:39:27,550 --> 00:39:28,150
Then...

466
00:39:29,400 --> 00:39:31,320
here's to life and love.

467
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:30,710
You stack the sugar cubes one by one,

468
00:41:33,550 --> 00:41:35,480
and then place them into the cup.

469
00:41:38,920 --> 00:41:40,760
Then you pour the coffee over them,

470
00:41:41,760 --> 00:41:43,760
letting its heat melt the sugar.

471
00:41:44,630 --> 00:41:47,280
That's how you taste both the bitter and the sweet.

472
00:42:25,110 --> 00:42:25,960
Done shooting.

473
00:42:28,550 --> 00:42:30,230
Usually, this is the only place

474
00:42:30,230 --> 00:42:31,230
where I can get my shooting fix.

475
00:42:32,710 --> 00:42:34,590
Weren't you representing Chinese security firms

476
00:42:34,800 --> 00:42:36,030
to talk with the embassy?

477
00:42:36,190 --> 00:42:37,110
Any results?

478
00:42:37,550 --> 00:42:38,190
They gave their answer.

479
00:42:39,840 --> 00:42:41,480
If we're permitted to carry guns,

480
00:42:41,710 --> 00:42:43,960
any mishap becomes an international incident.

481
00:42:44,440 --> 00:42:46,590
Neither country wants small matters like this

482
00:42:46,590 --> 00:42:47,710
to spark a dispute.

483
00:42:50,840 --> 00:42:52,920
All to ensure safety,

484
00:42:53,320 --> 00:42:56,070
they restrict the guns needed to ensure safety.

485
00:42:59,400 --> 00:43:00,800
What they call a "minor issue"

486
00:43:01,030 --> 00:43:03,400
was raised repeatedly under international law,

487
00:43:03,400 --> 00:43:05,920
only to be suppressed in the end.

488
00:43:08,590 --> 00:43:10,000
Join us at Zhong An.

489
00:43:11,110 --> 00:43:12,360
Is this really the only place you can shoot?

490
00:43:14,800 --> 00:43:15,670
Take a look at this.

491
00:43:30,550 --> 00:43:31,800
Because of this piece of paper,

492
00:43:31,800 --> 00:43:33,280
you'll be deported.

493
00:43:35,760 --> 00:43:36,550
Whatever.
